~ start
do Gs._stop()
Narrator: You need go to meeting room
set Gs.event = "meeting"
do Gs._play()
=> END

~ meet
do Gs._stop()
Director: Tomorrow is the New Year, and we need to take stock.
Analyst: We made 500 nail boxes in a year.
secretary: You can also now knock on the director's door.
Richard: * mentally* We should try it.
Economist: We have successfully completed the plan by 705.6 percent.
Manager: All the real estate in the area is now ours.
Security guard: Security has improved by 1234567,890 percent.
Director: Thank you, everyone's free!
Janitor: Yes, go to hell!
=> end_meet
=> END

~ end_meet
Narrator: That's the end of the meeting, and the assignment for today is on your screen.
do Gs._play()
do vis()
=> END